---
description: Keep generated hooks documentation synchronized with source changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Generated hooks documentation

- Before finishing any code change, run `yarn run hooks:check`.
- If it fails because generated hooks documentation is stale, run `yarn run hooks:generate`.
- Re-run `yarn run hooks:check` and include the generated documentation changes with the source change.
- Do not treat unrelated command failures as a reason to regenerate documentation.
